    "setup": "Two local meshtasticd instances with network.enabled_protocols = UDP_BROADCAST (0x0001), hand-written LocalConfig, default LongFast channel.",
    "note": "Our nodes, our channel, local only, no radio. Publishable under docs/TESTING.md."
